3. The applicant’s appropriate licensed design professional of record shall be responsible for the
following:
a. Providing a sampling plan for project construction and submitting it to the Department of
Development in conjunction with the request for the preconstruction meeting;
b. Providing a survey party for the stakeout of lines and grades to complete the work;
c. Providing a resident inspector to inspect the laying of the sanitary sewer line and the
storm drainage, including the preparation of an “as built” wye record;
d. Ensuring the inspection of the items described in Section 4.3.4.C.2(b), above;
e. Requesting intermediate site inspections by the Department of Development;
f. Providing a resident inspector to inspect the base processing;
g. Providing a resident inspector to inspect the street pavements including asphalt;
h. Providing a resident inspector to attend intermediate site inspections when called upon;
i. Providing a resident inspector to attend the final inspection;
